    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А я кто?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what am I?' Max playfully asks for his reward. He wonders what his new title is.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Круассан или сельдерей?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A croissant or celery?' He offers two funny options based on their history. Max asks if he is a croissant or celery.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Ну, конечно, круассан.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, of course a croissant.' Vika smiles and gives him the better option. She assures him he is definitely a croissant.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Почему круассан?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why a croissant?' Max pretends to be confused by the choice. He jokingly asks why she picked croissant.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я же не ем мучное.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don' He brings up a fake dietary restriction. Max claims he does not even eat baked goods.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Ты спас наш ресторан.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You saved our restaurant.' Vika ignores the joke and expresses genuine gratitude. She tells him he saved their restaurant.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Ты молодец, Макс.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You did great, Max.' She offers him sincere praise. Vika calls him a good guy and uses his name affectionately.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я просто сделал свою работу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I just did my job.' Max downplays his heroic actions. He humbly claims he was just doing his job.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Нет, это было круто.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, it was cool.' Vika refuses to let him be modest. She insists that what he did was actually very cool.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Ты очень помог мне.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You helped me a lot.' She acknowledges his personal support. Vika tells him he helped her a lot.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Спасибо тебе.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you.' Vika delivers a simple, heartfelt expression of gratitude. She thanks him sincerely.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Мой храбрый круассан.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
